{"ticker":"NVO","updated":"2026-11-13T00:40:32Z","profile":{"longName":"Novo Nordisk A/S","shortName":"Novo Nordisk A/S","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Drug Manufacturers - General","country":"Denmark","website":"https://www.novonordisk.com","fullTimeEmployees":68794,"marketCap":179199655936,"trailingPE":10.265152,"forwardPE":11.905962,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.53708875,"pegRatio":4.21,"targetMeanPrice":45.61039,"targetHighPrice":64.45204,"targetLowPrice":39.66277,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":12,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.056,"earningsGrowth":-0.158,"grossMargins":0.83333,"operatingMargins":0.50778997,"profitMargins":0.33921,"totalRevenue":333650001920,"beta":0.368,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":64.16,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":35.12,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":4.37},"summary":"Novo Nordisk A/S, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the research and development, manufacture, and distribution of pharmaceutical products. It operates through two segments, Obesity and Diabetes Care, and Rare Disease. The Obesity and Diabetes care segment provides products for diabetes, obesity, cardiovascular, and other emerging therapy areas. The Rare Disease segment offers products in the areas of rare blood disorders, rare endocrine disorders, and hormone replacement therapy. The company also provides NovoPen 6 and NovoPen Echo Plus, smart insulin pens; Dose Check, an insulin dose guidance application; growth hormone pens and injection needles; and Wegovy pill an oral glucagon-like peptide-1 (GLP-1) receptor agonist therapy for weight management. The company has a collaboration with Anthropic accelerate the development of new medicines and advance AI-driven software development. It operates in Europe, Canada, the United States, Japan, Korea, Oceania, Southeast Asia, Mainland China, Hong Kong and Taiwan, Latin America, the Middle East, and Africa. It has a strategic collaboration with Orbis Medicines to discover and develop oral macrocycle therapeutics for cardiometabolic diseases. The company was formerly known as Novo Industri A/S and changed its name to Novo Nordisk A/S in April 1989. The company was founded in 1923 and is headquartered in Bagsvaerd, Denmark.","summary_zh":"諾和諾德公司及其子公司從事醫藥產品的研發、製造和分銷。它透過兩個部門運作：肥胖和糖尿病護理以及罕見疾病。肥胖和糖尿病護理部門為糖尿病、肥胖、心血管和其他新興治療領域提供產品。罕見疾病部門提供罕見血液疾病、罕見內分泌疾病和荷爾蒙替代療法領域的產品。該公司還提供NovoPen 6和NovoPen Echo Plus智慧胰島素筆； Dose Check，胰島素劑量指導應用程式；生長激素筆和注射針； Wegovy 丸是一種用於體重管理的口服胰高血糖素樣勝肽-1 (GLP-1) 受體激動劑療法。該公司與 Anthropic 合作，加速新藥開發並推動人工智慧驅動的軟體開發。業務遍及歐洲、加拿大、美國、日本、韓國、大洋洲、東南亞、中國大陸、香港和台灣、拉丁美洲、中東和非洲。它與 Orbis Medicines 進行策略合作，發現和開發治療心臟代謝疾病的口服大環化合物療法。該公司前身為Novo Industri A/S，1989年4月更名為Novo Nordisk A/S。該公司成立於1923年，總部位於丹麥Bagsvaerd。","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"藥品製造商 - 一般","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":56.5,"h":56.98,"l":55.55,"c":55.62,"v":13764300},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":57.14,"h":57.73,"l":56.63,"c":57.2,"v":17115600},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":57.78,"h":59.15,"l":57.67,"c":58.2,"v":16809000},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":61.84,"h":62.25,"l":60.84,"c":61.85,"v":24602000},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":62.3,"h":62.32,"l":60.72,"c":61.4,"v":12902900},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":60.0,"h":61.12,"l":59.62,"c":60.71,"v":10742700},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":60.3,"h":60.33,"l":59.08,"c":59.54,"v":11510900},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":58.85,"h":59.25,"l":58.14,"c":58.74,"v":11232100},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":57.14,"h":57.35,"l":55.87,"c":56.04,"v":18287400},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":55.6,"h":56.02,"l":54.56,"c":55.61,"v":17739800},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":54.14,"h":55.64,"l":54.01,"c":55.5,"v":19329100},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":54.01,"h":55.57,"l":53.77,"c":55.49,"v":19003500},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":56.01,"h":59.22,"l":56.0,"c":59.17,"v":24835100},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":58.88,"h":59.12,"l":58.0,"c":58.74,"v":11966700},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":59.0,"h":60.1,"l":58.45,"c":59.63,"v":15362900},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":60.14,"h":60.9,"l":59.65,"c":59.65,"v":13782400},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":59.46,"h":59.59,"l":58.53,"c":59.02,"v":9675100},{"t":"2025-10-08","o